DOMAIN,doh.pub,DIRECT
DOMAIN,cloudflare-dns.com,DoH Proxy
DOMAIN,dns.google,DoH Proxy

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,kaggle.com,🇺🇸 US
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,kaggleusercontent.com,🇺🇸 US

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,msmp.abchina.com.cn,REJECT
